Before we hand over the code we need to change the default password within {{backend/src/PMHelmutSchmidtPortal.Core.Shared/Authorization/Users/UserConsts.cs}} which is used to create the {{admin}} and {{Portal_Admin}} accounts. The platform code is ment to be published publicly and also enable everyone who downloads and deploys the platform to use it (with this new default password).

Please adjust the corresponding section within the documentation as well. It should mention this default password, for which accounts it is used and remind the user to change it after deployment.



{panel:bgColor=#fffae6}
Important: This Ticket has to be developed on the old platform and will be deployed to the new one via sync fork.
{panel}

