*Schritt 01:* Als Admin befinde ich mich im Menüpunkt “Produktübersicht”. Ich erhalte eine tabellarische Übersicht über alle Produkte ([https://pmsoftware.atlassian.net/browse/HSU-9|https://pmsoftware.atlassian.net/browse/HSU-9|smart-link] )

*Schritt 02:* Nachdem ich auf das Produkt 02 (Status: In Bearbeitung Entwickler) geklickt habe, bekomme ich folgende Ansicht:

* Einen Info-Text, dass das Produkt z.Zt. vom Entwickler bearbeitet wird
* Das Datum der letzten Bearbeitung des Produkts
* Den Produktdetailstreifen, der die Informationen enthält, die bereits von mir oder dem Entwickler eingetragen und gespeichert wurden.



{color:#97a0af}_Step 01: As admin, I am in the menu item "Product overview". I get a tabular overview of all products (_{color}[https://pmsoftware.atlassian.net/browse/HSU-9|https://pmsoftware.atlassian.net/browse/HSU-9|smart-link]{color:#97a0af}  _)_{color}

{color:#97a0af}_Step 02: After I have clicked on product 02 (status: In progress developer), I get the following view:_{color}

* {color:#97a0af}_An info text that the product is currently being edited by the developer_{color}
* {color:#97a0af}_The date the product was last edited_{color}
* {color:#97a0af}_The product detail strip, which contains the information that has already been entered and saved by me or the developer._{color}

Devops just mounted a new folder ‘/uploads’ to dev/stage. The path can be found within a new env var in {{FILE_UPLOAD_BASE_PATH}}. This folder can be used for uploaded files as it is outside docker and therefore persistent after deployments. 

With that we should be able to use the same approach as they do in Innotec:

* Store the name of the new Environment Variable: 
{noformat}public static class AppCoreConsts
{
    public const string FILE_UPLOAD_PATH_ENV_VARIABLE_NAME = "FILE_UPLOAD_BASE_PATH";
}{noformat}
[https://github.com/pmagentur/innotec-platform/blob/development/backend/src/PmInnotec.Core.Shared/AppCoreConsts.cs|https://github.com/pmagentur/innotec-platform/blob/development/backend/src/PmInnotec.Core.Shared/AppCoreConsts.cs]
* Fetch path from Environment: 

{noformat}Environment.GetEnvironmentVariable(AppCoreConsts.FILE_UPLOAD_PATH_ENV_VARIABLE_NAME);{noformat}

[https://github.com/pmagentur/innotec-platform/blob/9ecdf0598402510b6c273bf4299d0228d466f4e8/backend/src/PmInnotec.Web.Core/Controllers/UploadController.cs#L76|https://github.com/pmagentur/innotec-platform/blob/9ecdf0598402510b6c273bf4299d0228d466f4e8/backend/src/PmInnotec.Web.Core/Controllers/UploadController.cs#L76]

