This Story is about creating the Step Sub-Component for the Diagramm.

----

*Technical Notes*:

* Create a state sub-component that extends the base sub-component
* Create states for {{flag}}, {{active}}, {{hovered}}, {{raw}}, {{final}} in a property with the name {{states}}
* Define event handling in the functions {{handleClickEvents}} and {{handleHoverEvents}}. These should call the {{onHover}} and {{onClick}} event callbacks at the end.
* Define functions {{onClick}}, {{onHover}} and set the corresponding states.
* Define {{render}} function.
** Rendering of the default step, hover states (green hover background)
* Define {{postRender}} function.
** Rendering of the hover buttons
* Define {{update}} function for the calculation of the button size WITHOUT the hover buttons. This size is used for positioning.



* {color:#97a0af}State Sub-Component erstellen, welche die basis Sub-Component erweitert{color}
* {color:#97a0af}States fuer {color}{{flag}}{color:#97a0af}, {color}{{active}}{color:#97a0af}, {color}{{hovered}}{color:#97a0af}, {color}{{raw}}{color:#97a0af}, {color}{{final}}{color:#97a0af} in einer Property mit dem namen {color}{{states}}{color:#97a0af} anlegen{color}
* {color:#97a0af}Event Handling in den functionen {color}{{handleClickEvents}}{color:#97a0af} und {color}{{handleHoverEvents}}{color:#97a0af} definieren. Diese sollen am ende die {color}{{onHover}}{color:#97a0af} und {color}{{onClick}}{color:#97a0af} Event Callbacks aufrufen.{color}
* {color:#97a0af}Functions {color}{{onClick}}{color:#97a0af}, {color}{{onHover}}{color:#97a0af} definieren und die entsprechenden States setzen.{color}
* {{render}}{color:#97a0af} function definieren.{color}
** {color:#97a0af}Rendering vom default Step, hover states (green hover background){color}
* {{postRender}}{color:#97a0af} function definieren.{color}
** {color:#97a0af}Rendering von den Hover Buttons{color}
* {{update}}{color:#97a0af} function definieren fuer die Berechnung der Button groesse OHNE die hover Buttons. Diese groesse wird fuer die Positionierung verwendet.{color}

This Story is about implementing a Sub-Component system for the Diagram. This will be used to implement Sub-Components like the Step or Connection.

----

Create base sub-component abstract class, which already contains sub-component independent properties (this is extended by sub-components such as the HSU-Step and HSU-Connection)

* {{x}}
* {{y}}
* {{width}}
* {{height}}
* {{anchor}}
** {{side}}
** {{target}}
* {{handleClickEventFn}} Handling of the "raw" click events from the base component
* handleHoverEventFn Handling of the "Raw" Hover/MouseExit events from the base component
* {{onHover}} The actual onHover function
** Return value should be an object with the values {{reRendering}}, {{preventDefault}} or null
* {{onClick}} The actual onClick function
** Return value should be an object with the values reRendering, preventDefault or null
* {{update}} Update function for e.g. calculating the size
* {{render}} Rendering of the sub-component
** Return value should be an object with the values: {{x}}, {{y}}, {{width}}, {{height}}, {{floating}}.
* {{postRender}} Post render of the sub-component (e.g. for hover side buttons)



* {color:#97a0af}Basis Sub-Component Abstract Class erstellen, welche bereits Sub-Component unabhaengige Properties beinhaltet (Diese wird von Sub-Components wie dem HSU-Step und HSU-Connection extended){color}
** {{x}}
** {{y}}
** {{width}}
** {{height}}
** {{anchor}}
*** {{side}}
*** {{target}}
** {{handleClickEventFn}}{color:#97a0af} Handling der “Raw” Click Events von der Basis Komponente{color}
** {{handleHoverEventFn}}{color:#97a0af} Handling der “Raw” Hover/MouseExit Events von der Basis Komponente{color}
** {{onHover}}{color:#97a0af} Die eigentliche onHover Function{color}
*** {color:#97a0af}Return value soll ein Object mit den Werten {color}{{reRendering}}{color:#97a0af}, {color}{{preventDefault}}{color:#97a0af} sein oder null{color}
** {{onClick}}{color:#97a0af} Die eigentliche onClick Function{color}
*** {color:#97a0af}Return value soll ein Object mit den Werten {color}{{reRendering}}{color:#97a0af}, {color}{{preventDefault}}{color:#97a0af} sein oder null{color}
** {{update}}{color:#97a0af} Update function fuer z.b. berechnung der Groesse{color}
** {{render}}{color:#97a0af} Rendering der Sub-Component{color}
*** {color:#97a0af}Return value soll ein Object sein mit den Werten: {color}{{x}}{color:#97a0af}, {color}{{y}}{color:#97a0af}, {color}{{width}}{color:#97a0af}, {color}{{height}}{color:#97a0af}, {color}{{floating}}
** {{postRender}}{color:#97a0af} Post-Render der Sub-Component (z.b. fuer hover side buttons){color}

