h3. Backend - Entities

* All Variants for the Measurements of one product should be stored in the same table as the default {{Measurement}} but with the flag {{default}} set to {{false}}
* For Material Variants we need a new Entity {{WorkPieceVariant}} which has the following properties:
** {{id}}
** {{WorkPieceVariantId}}
** {{description}}

h3. Backend - Endpoints

* {{GetProductVariants}} - this endpoint will return created measurements and variants. In addition we need Workpieces for the dropdowns 
* {{CreateOrUpdate}} - this endpoint will receive array with measurements and array with variants. Should be able to create, update and delete accordingly.

