{color:#97a0af}*_Step 02:_*{color}{color:#97a0af} _The previously ordered value chain is being processed ("In Bearbeitung" label). The status in the table for each step is also "In Bearbeitung". This remains as long as at least 1 line of the requested table shows the status "In Bearbeitung" or "Abgeschlossen". As soon as all rows contain the status "Abgeschlossen", the status of the requested value chain also changes to "Abgeschlossen" (see_ {color}[https://pmsoftware.atlassian.net/browse/HSU-244|https://pmsoftware.atlassian.net/browse/HSU-244|smart-link] {color:#97a0af} _)_{color}

{color:#97a0af}_The parent button "Auftrag stornieren" is disabled because the product has been ordered. Likewise, the refresh action can no longer be executed (disabled)._{color}

