This ticket is about to setup all roles necessary for this application. This includes the following roles:

* {{PlatformAdmin}}
* {{Producer}}
* {{Developer}}

Later on the {{PlatformAdmin}} will be the one to manage the application (account for our customer), than there are {{producer}} and {{developers}} using this application. These accounts should be manageable by the {{PlatformAdmin}} later on. 

The existing {{admin}} account should remain as some backup account for us to have access to the application in case we need it. This admin should have no restrictions within this application at all.

For now you just need to create the respective roles in the {{backend/src/PMHelmutSchmidtPortal.EntityFrameworkCore/Migrations/Seed/Host/HostRoleAndUserCreator.cs}} file. For how this is done you can have a look at the Hagebau Project: [https://github.com/pmagentur/pm-hagebau-extranet-admin-tools/blob/development/backend/src/PmHagebauExtranetAdminTool.EntityFrameworkCore/Migrations/Seed/Host/HostRoleAndUserCreator.cs|https://github.com/pmagentur/pm-hagebau-extranet-admin-tools/blob/development/backend/src/PmHagebauExtranetAdminTool.EntityFrameworkCore/Migrations/Seed/Host/HostRoleAndUserCreator.cs] 

For testing purposes please also create an {{PM_PortalAdmin}}, {{PM_Developer}} and {{PM_Producer}} account within the same file.

