{color:#97a0af}*_Step 08:_*{color}{color:#97a0af} _Producer 05 has accepted the request for processing and has entered the value chain planning by performing a work step. I can see this as admin in the respective cards Value Chain Planning, Producer Requests & Work Steps entered._{color}

