*Schritt 07:* Ich gebe eine Bemerkung für den Entwickler ein. Danach klicke ich auf den Button “Produkt freigeben”.

*Schritt 08:* Das neue Produkt befindet sich nun in der Tabelle der Produktübersicht. Das Produkt hat den Status “In Bearbeitung Entwickler” ({color:#ff5630}nähere Informationen zu den Stati siehe Ticket XY{color})



{color:#97a0af}*_Step 01_*{color}{color:#97a0af}_: As admin I am in the menu item "Produktübersicht". I get a tabular overview of all products (_{color}[https://pmsoftware.atlassian.net/browse/HSU-9|https://pmsoftware.atlassian.net/browse/HSU-9|smart-link]{color:#97a0af}  _) I click on the button "Produkt anlegen"._{color}

{color:#97a0af}*_Step 02_*{color}{color:#97a0af}_: A pop-up opens. I see the following fields:_{color}

* {color:#97a0af}_Product name (required field, free text field)_{color}
* {color:#97a0af}_Developer ( Required field, dropdown with typing & suggestion function)_{color}
* {color:#97a0af}_Comment (optional, free text)_{color}
* {color:#97a0af}_Buttons "Abbrechen" (enabled), "Angaben speichern(enabled), "Produkt freigeben"(disabled)_{color}

{color:#97a0af}*_Step 03_*{color}{color:#97a0af}_: I enter the product name_{color}

{color:#97a0af}*_Step 04_*{color}{color:#97a0af}_: I click in the dropdown to select a developer. When I click in the dropdown, I have the option to enter letters to search for a developer. In parallel, all developers are displayed alphabetically._{color}

{color:#97a0af}*_Step 05_*{color}{color:#97a0af}_: As soon as I enter letters, I get corresponding suggestions in the dropdown._{color}

{color:#97a0af}*_Step 06_*{color}{color:#97a0af}_: Once I have entered all the required fields, the "Produkt freigeben" button is enabled and I can release the product to the developer._{color}

{color:#97a0af}*_Step 07_*{color}{color:#97a0af}_: I enter a comment for the developer. After that I click on the "Produkt freigeben" button._{color}

{color:#97a0af}*_Step 08_*{color}{color:#97a0af}_: The new product is now in the product overview table. The product has the status "In Bearbeitung Entwickler" (for more information on the statuses, see ticket XY)._{color}
